   },
   "text": "Ms. Stevens moved to recommit to the Committee on Energy and Commerce. (text: CR H6187-6188)",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H30000",
   "actionDate": "2023-12-06",
   "actionTime": "17:21:48",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Considered as unfinished business. (consideration: CR H6187-6189)",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "2023-12-06",
   "actionTime": "17:21:47",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Pursuant to clause 1(c) of rule XIX, the House resumed consideration of H.R. 4468.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "2023-12-06",
   "actionTime": "13:43:52",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "POSTPONED PROCEEDINGS - Pursuant to clause 1(c) of rule XIX, the Chair announced further proceedings on H.R. 4468 would be postponed.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "2023-12-06",
   "actionTime": "13:35:44",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "DEBATE - Pursuant to the provisions of H. Res. 906, the House proceeded with 10 minutes of debate on the Johnson (OH) amendment No. 1.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "2023-12-06",
   "actionTime": "12:23:53",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "DEBATE - The House proceeded with one hour of debate on H.R. 4468.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "2023-12-06",
   "actionTime": "12:22:52",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Rule provides for consideration of H.R. 4468, H.R. 5933 and H.J. Res. 88. The resolution provides for consideration of H.R. 4468 and H.R. 5933 under a structured rule and H.J. Res. 88 under a closed rule. Rule provides for one hour of general debate and one motion to recommit on each measure.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H30000",
   "actionDate": "2023-12-06",
   "actionTime": "12:22:47",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Considered under the provisions of rule H. Res. 906. (consideration: CR H6157-6166; text: CR H6157-6158)",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H1L210",
   "actionDate": "2023-12-04",
   "actionTime": "17:52:31",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Rules Committee Resolution H. Res. 906 Reported to House. Rule provides for consideration of H.R. 4468, H.R. 5933 and H.J. Res. 88. The resolution provides for consideration of H.R. 4468 and H.R. 5933 under a structured rule and H.J. Res. 88 under a closed rule. Rule provides for one hour of general debate and one motion to recommit on each measure.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
